摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Give DSH agents direct control over Android devices and automotive bench rigs: device discovery, structured logcat, APK install, file pull/push, and performance snapshots. Built for on-vehicle and bench debugging workflows — generic within the domain (no Unity, no vendor protocol","id":"gh:1333938635","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-adb","slug":"SamXiaBing/dsh-adb","topics":["adb","android","automotive","bench","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Give DSH agents direct control over Android devices and automotive bench rigs: device discovery, str"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"uctured logcat, APK install, file pull/push, and performance snapshots. Built for on-vehicle and ben"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ch debugging workflows — generic within the domain (no Unity, no vendor protocol"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-adb"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> ADB device & bench operations for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Give DSH agents direct control over Android devices and automotive bench rigs: device discovery, str"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"uctured logcat, APK install, file pull/push, and performance snapshots. Built for on-vehicle and ben"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ch debugging workflows — generic within the domain (no Unity, no vendor protocol lock-in)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Or install directly from GitHub: `dsh plugin --profile web add github:SamXiaBing/dsh-adb`"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Web device panel (v1.1.0)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A **Devices** tab (UI label 设备) in the conversation view ring (next to chat / trajectory / automatio"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"n): device list with status, package autocomplete (fuzzy search), live streaming logcat window (leve"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"l/keyword/package/pid filters, pause/clear/auto-scroll), device info card, process list, performance"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" snapshot, and a **one-click health report** (UI label 设备体检 / Device Checkup: device identity, top-R"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"SS processes, crash buffer, W/E/F logcat window, storage — persisted under `reportDir`, sendable to "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"the conversation for diagnosis). The report turns raw evidence into signal before it reaches the mod"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"el: crash-buffer entries are classified into **real crashes (with stack chains) vs. MediaTek boot ma"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"rkers**, repetitive logcat is **aggregated by tag** (\"AOSP-MdnsDiscoveryManag ×3264\" instead of 3k i"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"dentical lines), and a compact **health summary** (verdict + issues) is attached — so the agent reas"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"ons from conclusions, not 17k raw lines. Plus harness synergy: **send any logcat/snapshot/report to "},{"id":"p10s11","text":"the conversation** (the agent analyzes it), a live strip of the agent's adb operations, and a regist"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"ered **crash-analysis skill** (`dsh-adb-crash-analysis`) for automation pipelines. Data flows over t"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"crash-analysis skill** (`dsh-adb-crash-analysis`) for automation pipelines. Data flows over t [长行截断]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Ecosystem"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- ✅ npm — `dsh-adb` published (latest: 1.6.0)\n- ✅ awesome-deepseek-harness#87 — **merged**\n- ✅ aweso"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"me-dsh-plugin#85 — **merged**\n- ✅ awesome-DSH-plugin#29 — **merged**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Topics: `dsh-plugin` `dsh` `adb` `android` `automotive` `bench`"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Tool | Description |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `adb_devices` | List devices (serial/state/product/model); run first to discover serials |\n| `adb_"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"connect` / `adb_disconnect` | Wireless bench connection (host:port, default 5555) |\n| `adb_logcat` |"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" Filtered read (tag/level/keyword/time-window/tail); `run_in_background` streams continuously as a j"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ob — read deltas with `job_output`, stop with `job_kill` |\n| `adb_install` | Install APKs (`-r`/`-d`"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"/`-g` options); validates the local file exists |\n| `adb_file` | pull / push / ls / rm, per-device i"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"solation |\n| `adb_perf_snapshot` | Structured `dumpsys meminfo / gfxinfo / battery` snapshots (PSS, "},{"id":"p16s7","text":"frame percentiles, jank rate, battery) |\n| `adb_perf_baseline` | Perf regression: save a snapshot as"},{"id":"p16s8","text":" a baseline (label/tags), compare current state and get a numeric diff (PSS, janky %, percentiles), "},{"id":"p16s9","text":"list/delete baselines (stored locally under `baselineDir`) |\n| `adb_crash_report` | One-call crash s"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"cene: parsed logcat crash buffer + dropbox excerpt + process state + memory summary |\n| `adb_device_"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"report` | One-click health report: device identity + top-RSS processes + crash buffer (real crashes "},{"id":"p16s12","text":"w/ stacks vs. boot markers) + W/E/F logcat aggregated by tag + storage + health verdict; each sectio"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"n degrades independently; persisted under `reportDir` |\n| `adb_wait_for` | Wait until a device condi"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"tion holds — device-online / boot-complete / process appeared / logcat keyword — polling up to a bud"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"get, instead of sleeping a fixed number of seconds; returns `matched:false` on timeout |\n| `adb_oper"},{"id":"p16s16","text":"ation_ledger` | Append-only device operation ledger (record/list/rollback): record installs/pushes/e"},{"id":"p16s17","text":"tc., list history, or roll an app back to its last known-good APK (`adb install -r`); persisted as `"},{"id":"p16s18","text":"operations.json` — the trust base for agent-driven device modification |\n| `adb_screenshot` | Captur"},{"id":"p16s19","text":"e the device screen into a local PNG (screencap → pull), returning the saved path, byte size, and pi"},{"id":"p16s20","text":"xel dimensions — durable evidence for crash scenes / UI states / test frames |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Approval guard (destructive operations)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Device-mutating calls route through harness's approval seam before executing: `adb_install`, `adb_fi"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"le push/rm`, and `adb_operation_ledger rollback` return a pre-execute `ask` decision with a human-re"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"adable reason (tool + serial + target), and the session's approval answerer (web UI card, ACP machin"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"e policy) decides. **Fail closed by design**: with no approval service loaded (headless) or a `never"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"` policy, these calls are denied — read-only tools are unaffected and need no approval wiring. This "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"mirrors the plugin-wide rule that \"couldn't check\" ≠ \"allowed\"."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Usage: adb_watch_crash (Crash Watchdog)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Watch the device's crash buffer for **new** real crashes. On start, it reads the current buffer and "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"remembers every existing crash signature (seed), so only crashes that appear *after* the watch begin"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"s are reported. Boot markers (`mtk-brm-*`) are not crashes and are ignored."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Foreground mode** (default) — blocks until a new crash appears or the budget expires:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Background mode** (`run_in_background`) — returns a job id immediately, keeps polling:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Chain with crash capture** — when a crash is detected, pair with `adb_crash_report` and `adb_scree"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"nshot` to capture the scene:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `serial` | string | defaultSerial | Target device serial |\n| `timeoutMs` | integer | 60000 | Watch"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" budget (max 600000 = 10 min) |\n| `intervalMs` | integer | 1000 | Poll interval (min 250) |\n| `withS"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"tacks` | boolean | true | Include same-pid stack lines per crash |\n| `run_in_background` | boolean |"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" false | Run as a background job; read via `job_output` |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
